    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "aliases": [
        "PU42Level2Intro"
      ],
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Even as the West was wild, so is my fury even wilder!",
              "zh": "多么整齐的草坪！真适合留下我战马车的蹄印！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Face me! Face me and the rebuilt and improved Zombot War Wagon!",
              "zh": "面对我吧！面对我和我重造的重型战马车！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "等等，又是这辆大铁马车？上次在西部，我们可被它折腾惨了！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "确实，戴夫先生。不过，这里是42号平行宇宙，我们有新的应对手段。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我带了更大的锅盖！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我指的是豆腐尸荚。这里的豆荚能够召唤军火，普通生长会释放自爆僵尸，使用叶绿素则能召唤战斗机。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "会爆炸的豆子，还有会开飞机的豆子？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "您可以这样记忆。召唤出的单位会为我们作战，请留意它们的进攻时机。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "太好了！上次他开着铁马车追我们，这次轮到我的豆荚出动了！"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "aliases": [
        "PU42Level2Outro"
      ],
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "All my efforts... useless! I begin to seriously question my capacity to succeed!",
              "zh": "我所有的努力……毫无用处！我开始严重怀疑自己获得成功的能力！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
                    {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "哈！这次我的豆子赢了你的铁马车！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "战斗结束。看来这个宇宙的豆腐尸荚，很适合应对重型战马车。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "它能召唤战斗机，应该也能召唤一辆玉米卷餐车吧？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "目前的召唤列表中没有餐车。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "那就把它列为下一项研究！打完这场，我饿了！"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "version": 1
}
